{"lesson_uid":"L0057","_provenance":{"generator":"backend/scripts/generate_lesson_zhuyin.py","reading_authority":"frontend/src/components/zhuyin/polyphonicProcessor.ts（跑，非移植）","source_font":"frontend/public/fonts/BpmfZihiSerif-Regular.ttf","font_sha256_16":"fc25a90d27699ec4","poyin_db_sha256_16":"882bc0ae69aeef35","notation":"pypinyin BopomofoConverter（與 font_readings.json 同一個轉換器）","stats":{"texts":225,"chars":5964,"poly_positions":1525,"he_adjudicated":0,"manual_corrections":0}},"texts":[{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"tvrxr","idx":1,"text":"鬧鐘響了，阿勝心不甘情不願的起床，睡眼惺忪，哈欠連連，一整天都覺得沒精神。小琪最近上課頻頻打瞌睡，為了抵抗瞌睡蟲，小琪狂喝含有咖啡因的茶飲，結果晚上睡不著、白天又起不來……","n":86,"ssz":"...........1...............2....1................1...................................."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"tvrxr","idx":2,"text":"阿勝和小琪都遇到睡眠不足的問題，你也有類似狀況嗎？回想過去一週，你自認睡眠充足嗎？","n":41,"ssz":"..1..........................2..........."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"tvrxr","idx":3,"text":"事實上，睡眠和健康關係密切，對成長中的國中生尤其重要。美國疾病管制與預防中心建議，青少年每天應睡8到10小時。換句話說，如果你預計早上6點半起床，想睡足8小時，最晚晚上10點半前就要準備入睡啦！","n":97,"ssz":"......1.....1...1.........................1......................................................"},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"tvrxr","idx":4,"text":"好好睡一覺，好處多多。當你以為身體在休息時，睡眠其實正幫助身體默默進行修復與調整：修復勞累一天的肌肉、調整各部分的運作，並清除代謝產生的廢物。如果老是睡不夠，身體恢復與修復的時間就會減少。長期下來，可能增加肥胖、糖尿病、心血管疾病及憂鬱等健康風險。","n":124,"ssz":"...2...1...............................................1....................1..............................................."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"tvrxr","idx":5,"text":"睡眠還能讓你學得更好。研究顯示，大腦在睡眠過程中會整理記憶，把白天接收的訊息去蕪存菁，保留重要部分，進一步形成長期記憶。睡眠不足時，大腦會較難吸收新知、回想細節，反應也會變慢，出錯率提高。古人有「懸梁刺股」的故事，其中「懸梁」是讀書時把頭髮用絲線綁在橫樑上，一打瞌睡，頭皮就會被拉扯而痛醒。你覺得這樣會有好的學習效果嗎？","n":160,"ssz":".......1........................................1..1...1..........................1..............................................2.................1............"},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"tvrxr","idx":6,"text":"雖然睡眠的重要性已廣為人知，仍有一些似是而非的觀念讓人混淆。有人說：「平日熬夜沒關係，假日再補眠就好。」但是，假日補眠不能代替平日充足、規律的睡眠；睡覺時間忽早忽晚、睡眠時數忽長忽短，也會打亂生理時鐘。想像身體裡有一個看不見的時鐘，它會調節我們何時想睡、何時醒來，以及何時感到飢餓、分泌荷爾蒙。如果經常打亂生理時鐘，就會影響睡眠品質。也有人認為：「睡前喝酒能幫助入眠。」喝酒後雖然可能較快入睡，卻容易在夜裡醒來，整體睡眠品質反而下降，第二天更加疲倦。因此，酒精不是睡眠的好朋友；睡前小酌，反而可能讓人睡得更不安穩。","n":257,"ssz":"................2..........................................................1................................1.1.......................................................................................................................1....................1....."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"tvrxr","idx":7,"text":"睡眠不足是現代人常見的問題，原因很多，其中睡前長時間使用3C產品，是常見原因之一。有些人明明可以準時睡覺，卻在臉書、IG、抖音等社群媒體流連忘返，捨不得睡，這就是所謂的「睡前拖延」。現代人白天工作或課業壓力大，夜裡上網或許能暫時放鬆；但若因此越睡越晚，白天更加疲倦，晚上又繼續滑手機，就會形成惡性循環，反而得不償失。","n":158,"ssz":"...................................................1.......................1.............................................................................1...."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"tvrxr","idx":8,"text":"聰明的你，現在應該知道怎麼「睡」對自己最有利了。今晚，睡前請放下手中的3C產品，讓煩擾的思緒慢慢安靜，對自己說一聲「晚安」。明天，當鬧鐘再次響起，你將以更飽滿的精神迎接新的一天。","n":89,"ssz":"........................................................................................."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"tvrxr","idx":9,"text":"祝你好眠，每一個夜晚。","n":11,"ssz":".......1..."},{"section":"key_reading","slug":"7rxjq","idx":null,"text":"好好睡一覺，好處多多。當你以為身體在休息時，睡眠其實正幫助身體默默進行修復與調整：修復勞累一天的肌肉、調整各部分的運作，並清除代謝產生的廢物。如果老是睡不夠，身體恢復與修復的時間就會減少。長期下來，可能增加肥胖、糖尿病、心血管疾病及憂鬱等健康風險。睡眠還能讓你學得更好。研究顯示，大腦在睡眠過程中會整理記憶，把白天接收的訊息去蕪存菁，保留重要部分，進一步形成長期記憶。睡眠不足時，大腦會較難吸收新知、回想細節，反應也會變慢，出錯率提高。古人有「懸梁刺股」的故事，其中「懸梁」是讀書時把頭髮用絲線綁在橫樑上，一打瞌睡，頭皮就會被拉扯而痛醒。你覺得這樣會有好的學習效果嗎？","n":284,"ssz":"...2...1...............................................1....................1......................................................1........................................1..1...1..........................1..............................................2.................1............"},{"section":"served:series","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一般","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:title","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"祝你好眠","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:genre","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"說明文","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:reading_strategy","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"摘要策略──從主題句找小主題","n":14,"ssz":".............."},{"section":"served:reading_strategy_explained","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這一課我們要練習「抓出重點」的功夫，也就是把文章裡藏著的小主題找出來\n這篇說睡眠有多重要，從有經驗的故事講到為什麼要睡飽，還有不能做什麼，這些點都很清楚\n所以讀的時候，你可以試著找找看，哪些句子最重要，可以幫你記住這篇在講什麼的重點喔","n":117,"ssz":".1........................................1...........1.........................................1...................1"},{"section":"served:reading_strategy_explained#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這一課我們要練習「抓出重點」的功夫，也就是把文章裡藏著的小主題找出來","n":34,"ssz":".1................................"},{"section":"served:reading_strategy_explained#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這篇說睡眠有多重要，從有經驗的故事講到為什麼要睡飽，還有不能做什麼，這些點都很清楚","n":41,"ssz":".......1...........1....................."},{"section":"served:reading_strategy_explained#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"所以讀的時候，你可以試著找找看，哪些句子最重要，可以幫你記住這篇在講什麼的重點喔","n":40,"ssz":"...................1...................1"},{"section":"served:intro.background","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這篇文章探討了睡眠對我們的重要性。文章首先以阿勝和小琪的經驗，引出睡眠不足可能造成的精神不濟與學習障礙。接著說明青少年每天建議的睡眠時數，並解釋充足睡眠如何幫助身體修復、調整，以及鞏固記憶、提升學習效率。此外，文章也破除了一些關於睡眠的迷思，例如假日補眠、睡前飲酒等觀念，並指出睡前過度使用 3C 產品是影響睡眠的常見原因。透過了解睡眠的奧秘，讓我們能更重視並安排健康的睡眠習慣，迎接充滿活力的每一天。","n":201,"ssz":"........................1...................1............1.....................................................2....................................................1...................................."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[0].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[0].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"讀全文-做記號","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[1].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"二","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[1].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"念順順","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[2].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"三","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[2].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"語詞我最棒","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[3].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"四","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[3].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"語詞應用","n":4,"ssz":"..1."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[4].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"五","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[4].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"文章重點表","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[5].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"六","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[5].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"閱讀聚光燈","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[5].subtitle","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"摘要策略─從主題句找小主題","n":13,"ssz":"............."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[6].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"七","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[6].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"閱讀理解","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[7].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"八","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[7].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"詞語複習","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[8].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"九","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[8].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"知識補給站","n":5,"ssz":"...1."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[0].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"去蕪存菁","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[0].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"去掉雜亂或不重要的部分，留下精華。","n":17,"ssz":".....1....1......"},{"section":"served:vocabulary[1].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"流連忘返","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[1].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"留戀某個地方或事物，捨不得離開，甚至忘了回去。","n":23,"ssz":"...1........1.........."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[2].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"得不償失","n":4,"ssz":"1..."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[2].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"得到的好處，不足以彌補遭受的損失。","n":17,"ssz":"....1............"},{"section":"served:vocabulary[3].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"惡性循環","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[3].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一個壞結果又造成下一個問題，使情況變得更糟。","n":22,"ssz":"..........1.......1..."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[4].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"小酌","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[4].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"指少量喝酒。","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:vocabulary[5].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"懸梁刺股","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[5].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"古人為了不打瞌睡，用疼痛讓自己保持清醒的故事；比喻刻苦讀書。","n":30,"ssz":".............................."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[6].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"睡眼惺忪","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[6].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"剛睡醒，眼睛半開，還很迷糊的樣子。","n":17,"ssz":"...............1."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[7].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"代謝","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[7].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"身體把養分轉成能量，並產生、排出廢物的過程。","n":22,"ssz":"....1................."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[8].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"生理時鐘","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[8].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"身體內控制睡眠、清醒、飢餓等規律的「時鐘」。例如，到了固定時間就會想睡或肚子餓。","n":40,"ssz":".....................................1.."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[0].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"良好的睡眠有助於身體正常（　），維持健康。","n":21,"ssz":"....................."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[1].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"聚餐時，叔叔只（　）一杯，沒有再多喝。","n":19,"ssz":".....1....2........"},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[2].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"為了準備會考，他每天刻苦讀書，展現出（　）的精神。","n":25,"ssz":"1........................"},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[3].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"為了省一點時間而闖紅燈，不僅危險，還可能受罰，真是（　）。","n":29,"ssz":"1..2........................."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[4].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他熬夜精神不好，上課聽不懂，回家又得熬夜補功課，形成（　）。","n":30,"ssz":".................1............"},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[5].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他每天熬夜打電動，白天上學時都（　），一直打瞌睡。","n":25,"ssz":"...................2....."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[6].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這篇文章（　）之後，內容顯得簡潔有力。","n":19,"ssz":".............1....."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[7].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"日月潭風光秀麗，讓無數遊客（　），讚嘆不已。","n":22,"ssz":"......................"},{"section":"served:vocab_bank.C","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"新陳代謝","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"下列語詞何者使用不正確？","n":12,"ssz":"........1..."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他昨晚睡得充足，早上精神飽滿，仍然「睡眼惺忪」","n":23,"ssz":"....1.................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"為了玩手機而熬夜，隔天整天沒精神，真是「得不償失」","n":25,"ssz":"1...................1...."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"整理報告時，他刪去重複內容，使文章更加「去蕪存菁」","n":25,"ssz":".........1..............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"遊客被湖邊美景吸引，逛得「流連忘返」，直到傍晚才離開。","n":27,"ssz":"...........1..............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"根據課文，有關睡眠的敘述，何者不正確？","n":19,"ssz":"...............1..."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"大腦在睡眠時會修復疲勞的肌肉","n":14,"ssz":".............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"好的睡眠可降低疾病發生的風險","n":14,"ssz":".............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"睡眠時可重組記憶，有助於學習","n":14,"ssz":".............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"不論老小，每個人每天都需要睡滿八小時","n":18,"ssz":"1.....1..........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"根據課文，為什麼睡前喝酒不能幫助入眠？","n":19,"ssz":".....1............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"酒精會使人睡不安穩","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"酒精會使人上癮、喝多易作夢","n":13,"ssz":"............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"酒精會讓大腦分泌過多荷爾蒙","n":13,"ssz":"............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"酒精易讓人產生「睡前拖延症」","n":14,"ssz":".............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"造成現代人有「睡前拖延」最主要的原因為何？","n":21,"ssz":"....................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"失眠導致晚上無法入睡","n":10,"ssz":".........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"睡前被3C內容吸引，停不下來","n":14,"ssz":"...........1.."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"大腦有其他的睡眠障礙","n":10,"ssz":".........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"大腦高速運轉不想入睡","n":10,"ssz":".........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"請閱讀下面的段落，哪一個小主題最適合這段文字？\n上課前沒有吃早餐，容易感到疲倦，也較難集中注意力。早餐能補充一上午所需的能量，讓大腦保持清醒。因此，吃早餐有助於維持上午的精神與專注力。","n":92,"ssz":"...........1..........................................1....................................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].question#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"請閱讀下面的段落，哪一個小主題最適合這段文字？","n":23,"ssz":"...........1..........."},{"section":"served:multip