,"n":18,"ssz":".................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[11].blanks[0].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"睡眠對學習的影響","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[12].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"二、找小主題：第六段","n":10,"ssz":".........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[13].paragraphs[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❶雖然睡眠的重要性已廣為人知，仍有一些似是而非的觀念讓人混淆。❷有人說：「平日熬夜沒關係，假日再補眠就好。」❸但是，假日補眠不能代替平日充足、規律的睡眠；睡覺時間忽早忽晚，也會打亂生理時鐘。❹也有人認為：「睡前喝酒能幫助入眠。」❺喝酒後雖然可能較快入睡，卻容易在夜裡醒來，整體睡眠品質反而下降。❻因此，酒精不是睡眠的好朋友；睡前小酌，反而可能讓人睡得更不安穩。","n":180,"ssz":".................2............................................................1..........................................................................1....................1....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[15].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"想一想：這一段提到哪兩種睡眠觀念？","n":17,"ssz":".....1..........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[15].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"假日補眠","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[15].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"睡前喝酒","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[15].options.3","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"早睡早起","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[16].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"→所以，這一段大概是在說明和睡眠有關的觀念。","n":22,"ssz":".....1.......1........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[18].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"哪一句能說出整段的主要內容？","n":14,"ssz":".1............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[18].options.6","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"句❻","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[19].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"→因此，句❶是本段的主題句。","n":14,"ssz":".............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[21].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"句❷到句❻主要在做什麼？","n":12,"ssz":"............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[21].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"舉出兩種睡眠迷思，並說明它們為什麼不正確。","n":21,"ssz":"..............1..1..."},{"sec